      "id": "MicrosoftSharePointAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite",
      "name": "Microsoft SharePoint Adapter for SAP Integration Suite",
      "description": "<p><p style=\"text-align: justify\">Microsoft SharePoint adapter is used to collaborate with people, create, update and retrieve Files, Folders, Lists and List Items effectively to meet the specific needs and enables automatic data integration.The adapter is available only for certain service plans of the SAP Integration Suite. For more information, see SAP Note <a href=\"https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/3188446\" rel=\"nofollow\">3188446</a></p>\n<p><strong>Product Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Create Folders</li>\n <li>Create Lists</li>\n <li>Create List items</li>\n <li>Update Columns</li>\n <li>Download Files</li>\n <li>Upload Files</li>\n <li>Create Content Types</li>\n <li>Retrieve Site information</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Oauth2 Authorization Code.</li>\n <li>OAuth2 Client Credentials.</li>\n <li>Dynamic header and property support in the receiver adapter.</li>\n <li>Desired response type from SharePoint (JSON or XML).</li>\n</ul></p>",
      "shortText": "Microsoft SharePoint adapter is used to create and manage Files, Folders, Lists and List Items in SharePoint application by SAP Cloud Integration.",
