    {
      "id": "SalesforcePubSubAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite",
      "name": "Salesforce Pub/Sub Adapter for SAP Integration Suite",
      "description": "<p>The SalesforcePubSub adapter facilitates and accelerates the implementation time of connecting to Salesforce Pub/Sub API. The adapter is available only for Standard service plans and above of the SAP Integration Suite. For more information, see SAP Note <a href=\"https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/3188446\" rel=\"nofollow\">3188446</a>.</p>\n<ul>\n <li>Allows you to <strong>subscribe</strong> to the channels to receive events.</li>\n <li>Supports&nbsp;<strong>publishing</strong> of events to channels with defined schemas.</li>\n <li>Retrieves schema from the Salesforce channel using the&nbsp;<strong>Get Schema</strong> operation.</li>\n <li>Offers secure authentication options using&nbsp;<strong>OAuth 2.0 Username-Password</strong> and <strong>OAuth 2.0 JWT Bearer</strong>.</li>\n <li>Using the Sender Adapter, you can retrieve events from a&nbsp;<strong>specific position (Custom)</strong>, <strong>earliest position (Earliest)</strong>, or <strong>latest position (Latest)</strong>.</li>\n <li>Provides an error-handling mechanism in case of subscription failure, allowing you to re-subscribe to the channel and retrieve events from the&nbsp;<strong>earliest position (Earliest)</strong> or <strong>latest position (Latest)</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Documentation:</strong></p>\n<p>All documentation, including the User Guide, and Release Notes are included in the documentation tab of this package.</p>\n<p><strong>Download Location:</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;To install the Adapter, refer to the Adapter Guide located in the Documents tab.</p>",
      "shortText": "This package includes the SalesforcePubSub Adapter and its documentation. The SalesforcePubSub adapter is an adapter available on SAP Integration Suite that facilitates message publishing and subscription via Salesforce Pub/Sub API.",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "vendor": "SAP",
      "mode": "READ_ONLY",
      "supportedPlatform": "Cloud Integration",
      "modifiedBy": "p.karthikeyan@sierradigitalinc.com",
      "creationDate": "1743166520110",
      "modifiedDate": "1743166520116",
      "createdBy": "p.karthikeyan@sierradigitalinc.com",
