      "name": "SAP Commerce Cloud - B2C Integration with SAP Cloud for Customer",
      "description": "<p>Integrate SAP Commerce Cloud with SAP Cloud for Customer, using a convenient solution. Enjoy a standardized integration scope with mostly pre-configured content for predictable and fast integration.</p>\n<p>This package allows replication of registered or updated customer data from&nbsp;SAP Commerce Cloud to SAP Cloud for Customer. Following features are provided by this package:</p>\n<ul>\n <li>Replicate customer data from SAP Commerce Cloud to SAP Cloud for Customer</li>\n</ul>",
