      "id": "SAPSuccessFactorsIntegrationwithServiceNow",
      "name": "SAP SuccessFactors Integration with ServiceNow",
      "description": "<p>This package supports the integration of SuccessFactors with ServiceNow. It has the following integration flows:</p>\n<p>- Integration that regularly picks changed Employee master data records (name, address, email, e.t.c) and creates users in ServiceNow.</p>\n<p><strong>Features</strong>:</p>\n<p>This integration flow allows replicates users from SuccessFactors to ServiceNow. The integration needs to be scheduled (if scheduled to recur) and checks for any changed or modified user data in SuccessFactors.</p>\n<p><strong>Exception Handling</strong>:</p>\n<p>During Integration Process, any exception raised is captured and send via email.</p>\n<p><strong>Note</strong>:<br>This package uses basic authentication for ServiceNow. In case you prefer to use OAuth, configure ServiceNow accordingly. Details for<br>the configuration can be found in the ServiceNow adapter Guide.</p>",
      "shortText": "This package supports the integration of SAP SuccessFactors with ServiceNow. It queries changed user records in SAP SuccessFactors and creates them in ServiceNow.",
      "version": "1.0.1",
      "vendor": "SAP",
