2025-11-27 11:05:21,867 INFO [CHAIN_END] outputs={'step': 'step-1', 'result': ['[{"id":"AdvancedEventMeshAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite","name":"Advanced Event Mesh Adapter for SAP Integration Suite","description":"<p>The advanced event mesh adapters enable the exchange of events to and from advanced event mesh brokers.</p>\\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\\n<p><strong>Sender:</strong></p>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: disc\\">\\n <li>\\n  <p>Consume Guaranteed (persistent) messages from an advanced event mesh queue</p>\\n  <ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle\\">\\n   <li>\\n    <p>Support for all queue types: Exclusive, Non-exclusive, and Partitioned queues</p></li>\\n  </ul></li>\\n <li>\\n  <p>Consume Direct (non-persistent) messages using a Topic Subscription</p></li>\\n <li>\\n  <p>Number of Parallel Consumers</p></li>\\n <li>\\n  <p>Choice of Acknowledgement Mode</p>\\n  <ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle\\">\\n   <li>\\n    <p>Immediate after message received</p></li>\\n   <li>\\n    <p>After successful completion of the message exchange</p></li>\\n  </ul></li>\\n <li>\\n  <p>Adapter-level message retry properties</p>\\n  <ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle\\">\\n   <li>\\n    <p>Initial delay until 2nd attempt</p></li>\\n   <li>\\n    <p>max attempts</p></li>\\n   <li>\\n    <p>exponential interval multiplier</p></li>\\n   <li>\\n    <p>support for REJECTED or FAILED outcomes for negative acknowledgements after delivery attempts exhausted</p></li>\\n  </ul></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Receiver:</strong></p>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: disc\\">\\n <li>\\n  <p>Publish Guaranteed (persistent) messages to a Topic (recommended) or Queue in advanced event mesh</p></li>\\n <li>\\n  <p>Publish Direct (non-persistent) messages to a Topic in advanced event mesh</p></li>\\n <li>\\n  <p>Destination can be dynamically set at runtime via header or property expression</p></li>\\n <li>\\n  <p>Support for multiple message payload types: Text, Byte, Map message types</p></li>\\n <li>\\n  <p>Turn publish into a request/reply �Requestor� that send a message to the Destination, sets ReplyToAddress and CorrelationID, and synchronously waits for a response</p></li>\\n <li>\\n  <p>Set User Properties on outgoing message</p></li>\\n <li>\\n  <p>Set SMF message properties such as Priority, DMQ Eligible, and CorrelationId on outgoing message</p></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Connection with advanced event mesh broker:</strong></p>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: disc\\">\\n <li>\\n  <p>Connect to any broker</p></li>\\n <li>\\n  <p>Support for various authentication modes:</p>\\n  <ul style=\\"list-style-type: circle\\">\\n   <li>\\n    <p>Basic</p></li>\\n   <li>\\n    <p>Client Certificate</p></li>\\n   <li>\\n    <p>OAuth2</p></li>\\n  </ul></li>\\n <li>\\n  <p>Support for setting less common connection properties</p></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong><em>The adapter is available only for certain service plans of the SAP Integration Suite. For more information, see SAP Note <a href=\\"https://me.sap.com/notes/3188446\\" rel=\\"nofollow\\">3188446</a>.</em></strong></p>","shortText":"The advanced event mesh adapters enable the exchange of events to and from advanced event mesh brokers.","version":"1.3.5","vendor":"SAP","mode":"READ_ONLY","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"s.shaik@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1716551401827","modifiedDate":"1761148463993","createdBy":"d.malarmani@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"SAPEventMesh,SAPCloudPlatformIntegrationSuite,SAPIntegrationSuiteadvancedeventmesh","keywords":"","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"e2f8b14b85d44ad98a07c0ca17806379","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":false,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'AdvancedEventMeshAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"AdvancedEventMeshPOC","name":"Advanced Event Mesh - POC","description":"<p></p>","shortText":"POC for Advanced Event Mesh","version":"1.0.0","vendor":"","mode":"EDIT_ALLOWED","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"d.malarmani@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1730986634517","modifiedDate":"1730986736412","createdBy":"d.malarmani@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"","keywords":"","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"41201e30fcdb453b8dda90fc5cc233a3","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":false,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'AdvancedEventMeshPOC\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"AEMRapidPilotday3","name":"AEM-Rapid-Pilot-day3","description":"<p></p>","shortText":"Package containing Integration Suite flows required for day 3 of the Rapid Pilot workshop - export package.","version":"1.0.0","vendor":"Solace","mode":"EDIT_ALLOWED","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"d.malarmani@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1716549103623","modifiedDate":"1716549103628","createdBy":"d.malarmani@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"","keywords":"","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"9832a5d922244a93954c4d72dc46b9ff","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":false,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'AEMRapidPilotday3\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"AIAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite","name":"AI Adapter for SAP Integration Suite","description":"<p>The AI adapter facilitates and accelerates the implementation time and reduces the complexity of connecting to Generative AI Hub (SAP AI Core) and other AI providers. The adapter is available only for Standard service plans and above of the SAP Integration Suite. For more information, see SAP Note&nbsp;<a href=\\"https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/3188446\\" rel=\\"nofollow\\">3188446</a>.</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>AI Adapter has two variants available: <strong>AICore-GenAIHub</strong>&nbsp;and <strong>Custom-OpenAI-REST</strong>.</li>\\n<li>AI Adapter supports <strong>OAuth2 Client Credential</strong> (<em>User Credentials)</em> and<strong> API Key alias (</strong><em>Secure Parameter</em><strong>)</strong> authentication methods for the AICore-GenAIHub and Custom-OpenAI-REST variant respectively.</li>\\n<li>AICore-GenAIHub employs harmonized API to allow you to use different foundation models without changing the client code.</li>\\n<li>You can configure orchestration to enable consumption of <strong>multiple GenAI models</strong> within a single workflow.</li>\\n<li>Custom-OpenAI-REST allows you to access a range of features using APIs like <strong>Chat Completions</strong>, <strong>Platform</strong> and <strong>Responses</strong>.</li>\\n<li>Custom-OpenAI-REST supports <strong>Basic</strong> configuration type that provides a convenient processing capability for supported versions whereas <strong>Advanced</strong> enables proficient users to perform calls with greater control while connecting to any API endpoint.&nbsp;</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Documentation:</strong></p>\\n<p>All documentation, including the User Guide, and Release Notes are included in the documentation tab of this package.</p>\\n<p><strong>Download Location:</strong></p>\\n<p>&nbsp;To install the Adapter, refer to the Adapter Guide located in the Documents tab.</p>","shortText":"This package includes the AI Adapter and its documentation. The AI adapter for SAP Integration Suite facilitates and accelerates the implementation time and reduces the complexity of connecting to Generative AI Hub (SAP AI Core) and other AI providers.","version":"1.0.0","vendor":"SAP","mode":"READ_ONLY","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"r.mohan@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1755668874501","modifiedDate":"1755668874511","createdBy":"r.mohan@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"SAPAICore","keywords":"","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"927421ddd11f4fb88bb1ef59d3696d86","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":true,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'AIAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"AIFExceptiontoEventMeshIntegration","name":"AIF Exception to Event Mesh Integration","description":"<p></p>","shortText":"This package handles AIF exceptions by sending error events to SAP Event Mesh for alerting and further processing. It enables automated monitoring and proactive issue resolution via SAP Notification Service.","version":"1.0.1","vendor":"","mode":"EDIT_ALLOWED","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"s.shaik@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1761901462042","modifiedDate":"1761901477139","createdBy":"s.shaik@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"","keywords":"","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"e6c2b61128904dd8a4d4471a1d3e9b62","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":false,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'AIFExceptiontoEventMeshIntegration\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"AmazonDynamoDBAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite","name":"Amazon DynamoDB Adapter for SAP Integration Suite","description":"<p><span style=\\"font-size: 12pt\\">The AmazonDynamoDB adapter facilitates and accelerates the implementation time of connecting to Amazon DynamoDB. The adapter is available only for Standard service plans and above of the SAP Integration Suite. For more information, see SAP Note <a href=\\"https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/3188446\\" rel=\\"nofollow\\">3188446</a>. &nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p><span style=\\"font-size: 14pt\\"><strong>Feature highlights:</strong></span></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Consistent Reads:</strong> AmazonDynamoDB adapter ensures that your data reads from database are consistent. This option will return the latest data while reflecting changes from successful write operations.</li>\\n<li><strong>High Data Availability: </strong><span dir=\\"ltr\\">AmazonDynamoDB&nbsp; adapter allows you to perform operations on&nbsp; heavily replicated data thereby reducing chances of data access failure</span>.&nbsp;</li>\\n<li><strong>Simple and Flexible Schema: </strong><span dir=\\"ltr\\">The adapter allows you to leverage hassle free flexible and schema less design of DynamoDB with enhanced querying capability</span>.</li>\\n<li><strong>Predictable Performance:</strong> <span dir=\\"ltr\\">Avoid worries about managing workloads, predictable latencies and reliable performance expected while using AmazonDynamoDB adapter.</span></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong><span style=\\"font-size: 14pt\\">Documentation:</span></strong></p>\\n<p>All documentation, including the User Guide, and Release Notes are included in the documentation tab of this package.</p>\\n<p><span style=\\"font-size: 14pt\\"><strong>Download Location:</strong></span></p>\\n<p>To install the Adapter, refer to the Adapter Guide located in the Documents tab.</p>","shortText":"This package include the AmazonDynamoDB Adapter and its documentation. The AmazonDynamoDB adapter facilitates and accelerates the implementation time of connecting to Amazon DynamoDB.","version":"1.0.0","vendor":"SAP","mode":"READ_ONLY","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"d.malarmani@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1724762057090","modifiedDate":"1724762057099","createdBy":"d.malarmani@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"AmazonDynamoDB","keywords":"","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"Technology Area Enterprise Technology","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"4fcc663950094e45a48cf72f7d4bb76d","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":true,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'AmazonDynamoDBAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"AmazonEventBridgeAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite","name":"Amazon EventBridge Adapter for SAP Integration Suite","description":"<p>The AmazonEventBridge adapter facilitates event ingestion and accelerates implementation time connecting to Amazon EventBridge. The adapter is available only for Standard service plans and above of the SAP Integration Suite. For more information, see SAP Note&nbsp;<a href=\\"https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/3188446\\" rel=\\"nofollow\\">3188446</a>. &nbsp;</p>\\n<p><strong>Feature highlights:</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n <li><strong>Amazon EventBridge Operation Support:</strong> You can send events to event buses for further processing in your event driven systems.</li>\\n <li><strong>Ease of Access and Connectivity:</strong> Save connection related details on our platform to simplify operations and connectivity.&nbsp;</li>\\n <li><strong>Dynamic configuration with headers and properties:</strong><em> </em>Assigning dynamic values to different properties allows enhanced flexibility to your integration flows.&nbsp;</li>\\n <li><strong>Multiple Event Bus Support: </strong>You can send events to a single event bus using the basic type of operation whereas the advanced operation type allows you to send events to multiple event buses at a time.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Documentation:</strong></p>\\n<p>All documentation, including User Guide and Release Notes are included in the documentation tab of this package.</p>\\n<p><strong>Download Location:</strong></p>\\n<p>To install the Adapter, refer to the Adapter Guide located in the Documents tab.</p>","shortText":"This package includes the Amazon EventBridge Adapter and its documentation. The adapter facilitates sending events and accelerates the implementation time of connecting to Amazon EventBridge.","version":"1.0.1","vendor":"SAP","mode":"READ_ONLY","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"r.mohan@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1741346585027","modifiedDate":"1741346585033","createdBy":"r.mohan@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"AmazonWebServices","keywords":"","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"270b743370bc45aa941396f242bfcb8e","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":true,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'AmazonEventBridgeAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"AnaplanAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite","name":"Anaplan Adapter for SAP Integration Suite","description":"<p>The Anaplan Adapter facilitates and accelerates the implementation time and reduces the complexity of connecting to Anaplan. The adapter is available only for Standard service plans and above of the SAP Integration Suite. For more information, see SAP Note <a href=\\"https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/3188446\\" rel=\\"nofollow\\">3188446</a>. &nbsp;</p>\\n<p><strong>Feature highlights:</strong></p>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: disc\\">\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>Secure Connection:</strong>&nbsp; Secure connectivity to Anaplan using Authentication token obtained via OAuth2 Authorization Code or Basic Authentication mechanisms.</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: disc\\">\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>Support for Standard Operations: </strong>Delete File, Download File, Export and Download, Get Resource By ID, List Resource, Start an Action, Upload and Import, Upload File.</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: disc\\">\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>Flexibility to orchestrate multiple operations:</strong>&nbsp; You can perform multiple operations in a single call like Export &amp; Download.&nbsp;</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: disc\\">\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>Dynamic configuration with headers and properties:\u202f </strong>Assigning dynamic values to different properties allows enhanced flexibility to your integration flows. You can also refer to dynamic parameters using SAP Integration exchange headers and properties.&nbsp;</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<ul style=\\"list-style-type: disc\\">\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>Support for multiple payload formats:</strong> You can provide payload in different formats like JSON, TEXT, and XML.&nbsp;</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Documentation:</strong></p>\\n<p>All documentation, including the User Guide, and Release Notes are included in the documentation tab of this package.</p>\\n<p><strong>Download Location:</strong></p>\\n<p>To install the Adapter, refer to the Adapter Guide located in the Documents tab.</p>","shortText":"This package includes the Anaplan Adapter and its documentation. The Adapter facilitates and accelerates the implementation time and reduces the complexity of connecting to Anaplan.","version":"1.2.0","vendor":"SAP","mode":"READ_ONLY","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"r.mohan@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1749465623399","modifiedDate":"1749465623405","createdBy":"r.mohan@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"Anaplan","keywords":"","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"Technology Area Enterprise Technology","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"aaa31b491b4b4eb0bb01a8cc6d83e023","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":true,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'AnaplanAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"APIManagement","name":"API_Management","description":"<p></p>","shortText":"Test","version":"","vendor":"","mode":"EDIT_ALLOWED","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"s.ummaka@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1723050779471","modifiedDate":"1723050779474","createdBy":"s.ummaka@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"","keywords":"","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"92b6c59c6e8c441fb1f540459325c0a5","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":false,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'APIManagement\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"AzureAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite","name":"Azure Adapter for SAP Integration Suite","description":"<p><span>SAP provides Azure adapter, which offers various types of API based operations to integrate Azure storage.The adapter is available only for certain service plans of the SAP Integration Suite. For more information, see SAP Note <a href=\\"https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/3188446\\" rel=\\"nofollow\\">3188446</a></span></p>\\n<p><strong>Product Features:</strong> &nbsp;</p>\\n<p><strong>� Azure Blob Storage:</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n <li>Create Container in the storage</li>\\n <li>List the Containers from the storage</li>\\n <li>Delete a Container from the storage</li>\\n <li>Upload Block Blob into the Container</li>\\n <li>Upload Append Blob into the Container</li>\\n <li>Upload a Blob from URL of another Container into the specified Container</li>\\n <li>List the Blobs in the Container</li>\\n <li>Get the specified Blob properties</li>\\n <li>Get or Set the Metadata for the Blob</li>\\n <li>Download Blob from the Container</li>\\n <li>Delete a Blob from the Container &nbsp;</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>� Azure File Storage:&nbsp;</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n <li>Create Share in the storage</li>\\n <li>List Share from the storage</li>\\n <li>Delete Share in the storage</li>\\n <li>Get Share Properties in the storage</li>\\n <li>Upload File in the Directory or Share in the storage</li>\\n <li>List Directories and Files in the Share</li>\\n <li>Delete Directory in the Share</li>\\n <li>Download File from the Directory or Share</li>\\n <li>Get File properties of the File from the Directory or Share</li>\\n <li>Get or Set Metadata for the File &nbsp;</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>� Azure Queue Storage:</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n <li>Create Queue in the storage</li>\\n <li>List Queues in the storage</li>\\n <li>Delete Queue from the storage</li>\\n <li>Create Message in the Queue</li>\\n <li>Get Message(s) or Peek Message(s) from the Queue</li>\\n <li>Update Message in the Queue</li>\\n <li>Delete Message from the Queue</li>\\n <li>Get or Set Metadata for the Queue &nbsp;</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>� Azure Table Storage:</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n <li>Create Table in the storage</li>\\n <li>List the tables from the storage</li>\\n <li>Delete Table from the storage</li>\\n <li>Add entity to the table</li>\\n <li>Get entity(ies) from the table</li>\\n <li>Update entity in the table</li>\\n <li>Delete entity from the table&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong> &nbsp;</p>\\n<ul>\\n <li>Shared Access Signature token-based authorization</li>\\n <li>Shared Access Key based authorization</li>\\n <li>Dynamic header and property support in the receiver adapter.</li>\\n <li>Desired response type from Azure (JSON/XML)</li>\\n <li>Post processing File handling &nbsp;</li>\\n</ul>","shortText":"Azure Adapter facilitates integration of four different Azure storages - Blob, File, Queue and Table - with SAP Cloud Integration.","version":"1.0.3","vendor":"SAP","mode":"READ_ONLY","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"d.malarmani@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1707849519221","modifiedDate":"1707849519229","createdBy":"d.malarmani@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"SAPCloudPlatformIntegration,SAPCloudPlatformIntegrationSuite,Azure","keywords":"Adapter for SAP,Adapter,Azure,Azure Adapter,SAP Integration Suite,Suite,Integration Suite,Azure Suite","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"092a6cb5e7e3480b971e535906c8112a","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":true,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'AzureAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"BPP","name":"BPP","description":"<p></p>"