 <li>Create List items</li>\\n <li>Update Columns</li>\\n <li>Download Files</li>\\n <li>Upload Files</li>\\n <li>Create Content Types</li>\\n <li>Retrieve Site information</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n <li>Oauth2 Authorization Code.</li>\\n <li>OAuth2 Client Credentials.</li>\\n <li>Dynamic header and property support in the receiver adapter.</li>\\n <li>Desired response type from SharePoint (JSON or XML).</li>\\n</ul></p>","shortText":"Microsoft SharePoint adapter is used to create and manage Files, Folders, Lists and List Items in SharePoint application by SAP Cloud Integration.","version":"1.0.3","vendor":"SAP","mode":"READ_ONLY","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"r.mohan@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1738927290466","modifiedDate":"1738927290482","createdBy":"r.mohan@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"Microsoft,MicrosoftSharePoint,SAPCloudPlatformIntegration,SAPCloudPlatformIntegrationSuite","keywords":"Adapter,Adapter for SAP,Integration Suite,Microsoft SharePoint,Microsoft SharePoint Adapter,Microsoft SharePoint Suite,SAP Integration Suite,Suite","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"ee33ef8e4d5c445bb566a31736d3bda9","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":true,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'MicrosoftSharePointAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"MicrosoftTeamsAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite","name":"Microsoft Teams Adapter for SAP Integration Suite","description":"<p><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\">The Microsoft Teams adapter facilitates and accelerates the implementation time and reduces the complexity of connecting to Microsoft Teams. The adapter is av