normal\\">).</span></span></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\"><strong>Documentation:</strong></span></p>\\n<p><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\">All documentation, including the User Guide, and Release Notes are included in the documentation tab of this package.</span></p>\\n<p><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\"><strong>Download Location:</strong></span></p>\\n<p><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\">&nbsp;To install the Adapter, refer to the Adapter Guide located in the Documents tab.</span></p>","shortText":"This package includes the Microsoft Teams Adapter and its documentation. The Microsoft Teams Adapter is available on SAP Integration Suite. It facilitates and accelerates implementation time and reduces the complexity of connecting to Microsoft Teams.","version":"1.0.0","vendor":"SAP","mode":"READ_ONLY","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"r.mohan@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1762862145583","modifiedDate":"1762862145589","createdBy":"r.mohan@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"MicrosoftTeams","keywords":"","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"dbef64f7444b48ab998db15338d106de","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":false,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'MicrosoftTeamsAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"MigratingInterfaceFTFSD","name":"MigratingInterface_FTF_SD","description":"<p></p>","shortText":"Migrating interfaces from SAP PIPO to SAP CPI","version":"1.0.1","vendor":"","mode":"EDIT_ALLOWED","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"s.shaik@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1763120251818","modifiedDate":"1763120251820","createdBy":"s.shaik@sierradigitalinc.com