      "id": "ReplaymessagesfromQueuesviaSAPEventMesh",
      "name": "Replay Messages from Queues via SAP Event Mesh",
      "description": "<p>This package contains three integration flows:</p>\n<ol>\n <li>Retrieves the messages from SAP Event Mesh using AMQP Adapter and pushes the messages into a JMS Queue.</li>\n <li>Picks up the message in the JMS Queues and forwards it to the respective receiver endpoint using ProcessDirect.</li>\n <li>ProcessDirect integration flow that processes the message to the relevant receiver.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>It also includes a Value Mapping that maps the message from a JMS Queue to the correct ProcessDirect Endpoint.</p>",
      "shortText": "This package provides a replay mechanism for SAP Event Mesh messages.",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "vendor": "SAP",
