      "id": "SAPBrokerReconciliationforCommodityDerivativesIntegrationwithThirdPartySystem",
      "name": "SAP Broker Reconciliation for Commodity Derivatives Integration with Third-Party System",
      "description": "<p>This integration package enables you to integrate security class data and position data from the system to be connected to SAP Broker Reconciliation for Commodity Derivatives for statement reconciliation. This integration is applicable for third-party systems.</p>\n<p>The following functions are supported:&nbsp;</p>\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal\">\n <li><p>Retrieve security class data from a third-party system.&nbsp;</p></li>\n <li><p>Retrieve trading broker transactions from a third-party system.&nbsp;</p></li>\n <li><p>Retrieve clearing broker transactions from a third-party system.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li>\n <li><p>Send notifications to the configured e-mail ID in case of integration flow errors.</p></li>\n <li><p>Transform the retrieved data to the target schema.&nbsp;</p></li>\n <li><p>Save error logs as attachments in the Cloud Integration tenant.</p></li>\n</ol>",
      "shortText": "Enables integration of security class data and position data for statement reconciliation",
      "version": "3.0.0",
      "vendor": "SAP",
      "mode": "EDIT_ALLOWED",
